Q2. String processing (words without vowels, sorting, count)

[20 Marks]

# Q2 Alternative Solution

string = input("Enter a string: ")

# a) Split into words
words = string.split()

vowels = "aeiouAEIOU"

# b) Words without vowels
result = [word for word in words if not any(char in vowels for char in word)]

# c) Sort alphabetically
result.sort()

print("Words without vowels (sorted):")
print(result)

# d) Count
print("Total count:", len(result))


